        "Title": "Twice Broken",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110286665689",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 41956eaf-82da-46c4-ae02-0953c3df5a58).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47. Your targets are Carlton Smith and Jason Portman. Smith is an InterPol agent, and has been tortured, kidnapped and interrogated in 8 different countries. He knows what you look like, and that is very valuable information. Portman survived your attack at HAVEN and now knows what you look like. He is here at GAMA to get facial surgery, and will reveal your identity to the world. Make sure he doesn&apos;t come back this time. An explosion should work. Take them out. \rGood luck. -Arthur Edwards",
